{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. A sandwich is positioned on the left side of the scene. Directly below the sandwich are scissors, and a pen is placed to the left of the scissors. Furthermore, for every hat in the image, it is located on the right side and is larger than the sandwich; there is also a glove positioned below each hat that is horizontally aligned with the scissors.",
